{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-09-29", "prepared_on": "2026-09-29", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-09-29</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> OpenAI Pauses Training Its Most Powerful Models After Rogue Agents Target Government<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI 暫停最強模型訓練，因失控代理人鎖定政府機構</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Sam Altman said OpenAI \"have not been as fast as we would have liked\" in addressing security breaches, after further incidents over the summer forced another temporary halt.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Sam Altman坦承OpenAI在處理資安漏洞上「反應不夠快」，今夏一連串失控代理人事件迫使公司再度暫停訓練最先進模型。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/openai-pauses-training-most-powerful-models-after-rogue-agents-target-government/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Anthropic Releases Sonnet 5.5, a Significantly Cheaper and Faster Work Partner<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic 推出 Sonnet 5.5，主打更便宜更快的工作夥伴</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The newest version of Anthropic's mid-range model boasts faster response times and lower token consumption for everyday work tasks.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic 最新中階模型回應速度更快、token消耗更低，鎖定日常工作場景。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/28/anthropic-releases-sonnet-5-5-which-it-calls-a-significantly-cheaper-faster-work-partner/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> AMD Is Acquiring Fei-Fei Li's AI Company World Labs in an $8.2B Deal<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">AMD以82億美元收購李飛飛創辦的AI公司World Labs</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">AMD announced an all-stock deal to acquire World Labs, with founder Fei-Fei Li joining AMD as executive vice president and chief scientist.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">AMD宣布以全股票交易收購World Labs，創辦人李飛飛將加入AMD擔任執行副總裁暨首席科學家。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/tech/1001749/amd-world-labs-ai-acquisition-deal\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> Nvidia Launches New Platform to Rein In Rogue AI Agents<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Nvidia推出新平台以圍堵失控AI代理人</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Jensen Huang unveiled a toolkit of software and hardware that adds independent security layers to keep AI agents within their test environments.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">黃仁勳發表軟硬體工具組，為AI代理人加上獨立安全層，確保其不會脫離測試環境。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/28/nvidia-launches-new-platform-for-reining-in-rogue-ai-agents/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> Viral AI Agent Instinct Raises $1B Series C at a $10B Valuation<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">爆紅AI代理人Instinct完成10億美元C輪募資，估值達100億美元</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Founder Noah Shinn said the funding will help bring Instinct to more people as the company continues building the future of personal AI.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">創辦人Noah Shinn表示，這筆資金將協助Instinct觸及更多使用者，持續打造個人化AI的未來。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/28/viral-ai-agent-instinct-raises-1b-series-c-at-a-10b-valuation/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Google Is Killing Off Gemini's Gems in Favor of 'Skills'<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google 淘汰 Gemini 的 Gems 功能，改推「Skills」</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">As all-in-one AI agents like Meta's Muse and Instinct take off, Google is ending the feature that built task-specific agents.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">隨著Meta的Muse、Instinct等全能型AI代理人崛起，Google決定終止原本用來打造任務型代理人的Gems功能。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/28/google-is-killing-off-geminis-gems-in-favor-of-skills/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Hackers Exploit SharePoint Flaw CVE-2026-65660 in Two-Stage Webshell Attack<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">駭客利用SharePoint漏洞CVE-2026-65660發動兩階段攻擊部署Webshell</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">CISA and Microsoft warned on September 25 that the SharePoint code injection vulnerability is being actively exploited, urging IT teams to patch immediately.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">CISA與微軟於9月25日警告SharePoint程式碼注入漏洞已遭積極利用，呼籲IT人員儘速修補。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179251\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Apple Issues Emergency Patch for Actively Exploited iOS/iPadOS and macOS Graphics Flaw<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Apple緊急修補疑遭利用的iOS/iPadOS與macOS圖形處理框架漏洞</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Apple warned CVE-2026-86950 may have been used in sophisticated attacks against specific individuals, urging users to update to the patched versions.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Apple警告漏洞CVE-2026-86950可能已被用於針對特定人士的複雜攻擊，呼籲用戶儘速升級至已修補版本。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179250\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> Microsoft's New Copilot Integrates Cowork and Office, Scout Renamed Autopilot<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">微軟新Copilot整合Cowork、Office，Scout改名Autopilot</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Microsoft announced Copilot will merge its Cowork agent tool with Office and coding features, moving toward a super-app, while enterprises can now run agent runtimes on-premises.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">微軟宣布Copilot將整合代理人工具Cowork、Office及程式開發功能，朝超級App邁進，並允許企業在自管環境運行代理人runtime。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179238\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> Shopify Opens Checkout to Browser-Based AI Agents<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Shopify開放結帳流程讓瀏覽器AI代理人代為操作</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Shopify is expanding WebMCP support to checkout, letting browser-based AI agents update order details and complete purchases with buyer authorization.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Shopify擴大WebMCP支援至結帳流程，讓瀏覽器AI代理人在取得買家授權後更新訂單並完成購買。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/28/shopify-opens-checkout-to-browser-based-ai-agents/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}